package two_factor_auth_notification

// EnTextは英語版の二要素認証の設定の変更の通知メール (テキスト形式) です
templ EnText(kind Kind) {
	switch kind {
		case KindEnabled:
			Two-factor authentication has been turned on for your Annict account.

			From now on, you will be asked for a code from your authenticator app after signing in with your password or an emailed code. If you lose access to your authenticator app, you can sign in with one of the recovery codes shown when you turned it on.
		case KindDisabled:
			Two-factor authentication has been turned off for your Annict account.

			You will no longer be asked for a code from your authenticator app when signing in. Your recovery codes can no longer be used either.
		case KindDisabledByAdmin:
			At your request, an administrator has turned off two-factor authentication for your Annict account.

			You will no longer be asked for a code from your authenticator app when signing in. Your recovery codes can no longer be used either. After signing in, you can turn two-factor authentication on again from your settings.
	}

	If you did not make this change, someone else may have used your account. Please change your Annict password, then let us know at hello@annict.com so that we can investigate.
}
